    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "5c45c06aadeb",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "We had one rule for the thrillers on this list: there had to be something worth arguing about."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "c36281f6707c",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "d71859de2bde",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Maybe it’s whether a character can be trusted. Maybe it’s whether one clue changes how you see everything that came before it. Either way, these 12 books will give you plenty of material for theories, predictions, and strong opinions."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "3aed3d132fe6",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "27a345c88929",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "A quick tip for a bit more fun: get everyone to commit to their theories before you reach the final chapters."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   }
